# autotune-usb-applied: Auto Tune multimode (issue #205) APPLYING a confirmed
# suggestion and then UNDOING it inside the 5000 ms window.
#
# The whole SSB flow of section 6, driven through the user's own button:
#
#   1st press  -> COLLECT -> PREVIEW, the dial does NOT move
#   2nd press  -> APPLY: exactly one write to start + 752 and the session stays
#                 alive in the 5000 ms Undo window ("applied - press again to
#                 undo")
#   3rd press  -> UNDO: back to start, session over ("restored")
#
# scenario_settle codifies all three instants, so this fixture fails if the first
# press silently retunes, if the second press does not apply, if the apply happens
# twice, or if the Undo does not restore. The voice mass is the same TEST-ONLY one
# as `autotune-usb` (mocks/mock_dsp.c): 2850 Hz above the dial, +752 Hz suggested.
#
# No intelligibility claim is made anywhere: the suggestion is a gross alignment
# of occupied energy, and the operator is the one who confirms it.

name autotune-usb-applied
screen autotune-usb-applied

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 96000

mode usb
filter_low 0
filter_high 3000
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
